SELECT graph_add_vertex_label('nosuch', 'x', 'person');            -- error: no graph
ERROR:  graph "nosuch" does not exist
CONTEXT:  PL/pgSQL function graph_add_vertex_label(text,text,regclass,name) line 10 at RAISE
